Fioweb
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 77 ROTATE 1 U 2
COLUMN 6 FACE_LAST

OHID 7 FACE_ALL
OHID 0 FACE_ALL
OHID 3 FACE_ALL
OHID 7 FACE_ALL
OHID 2 FACE_ALL
OHID 2 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE_STACK COLUMN OHID
SRC Rank K
MOVE_STACK OHID OHID
DEST Size == 10
$win
AND
    PILE ALL OHID Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
